# AI Assistance Disclosure:
# Tool: Claude Code (model: Claude Opus 5.5), date: 2026-10-13
# Scope: Drafted Credit container settings for the database, broker, User and Order
# connections, and the shared Order secret.
# Author review: I validated correctness and supplied additional boundary checks.

# Copy to .env.docker locally. Do not commit the populated file.
ENVIRONMENT=development
# Use only Credit's database credentials. No migration runs on service startup.
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://<credit-user>:<password>@host.docker.internal:16522/postgres

# Team-agreed starting credit for every wallet (registration or first use by an existing user).
INITIAL_CREDIT_ALLOCATION=20
# Dedicated Order-to-Credit credential. Must equal Order's CREDIT_SERVICE_SECRET.
ORDER_SERVICE_SECRET=
# Fixed User origin for current-session checks. Root Compose overrides it with service DNS.
USER_SERVICE_BASE_URL=http://host.docker.internal:8000
DEPENDENCY_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=2
